ities.<br>4. Rich equipment, weapons, free combination.<br><br>Game play:<br>1. Composition rules: More than three connected wooden armour people (the same kind of the same), synthetic advanced wooden armour people.<br>2. Three branches, free choice.<br>3. City upgrade and match equipment.<br><br>Wooden armour man introduction:<br>1. Assassin, short range single point attack.<br>2. Swordsman, short range straight line attack.<br>3. Warrior, short range fan attack.<br>4. Archer, long Range curve attack.<br>5. Hercules, long range round attack.<br>6. Lancers, long range line attack.<br>7. Fang Shi, remote gas Debuff.<br>8. Phantom Master, remote vertigo Debuff.<br>9. Doctor, remote healing Buff.<br><br>Introduction of the enemy:<br>1. Ordinary monsters, balanced health and speed.<br>2. Speed monster, fast speed, but low blood volume.<br>3. Split Monsters: The first death will split two monsters.<br>4. boss, horrible blood amount. New player killer.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525130/extras/9b8f721898d1f6e16f3067afd07c4b82.avif?t=1704421774\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525130/extras/e9b11be67ef615de666ced311e540a0b.poster.avif?t=1704421774\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525130/extras/e9b11be67ef615de666ced311e540a0b.webm?t=1704421774\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525130/extras/e9b11be67ef615de666ced311e540a0b.mp4?t=1704421774\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2525130/extras/50f97bca5725645ab7a87743a2bd8897.poster.avif?t=170442